{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">叫外賣居然送上「咳藥水」？網絡近日瘋傳一則極具話題性的外賣經歷，有網民外賣點了一份魚生飯，打開後發現盛載豉油的容器令人啼笑皆非。樓主將照片上載至網絡並寫道：「叫外賣，佢俾左支豉油我」。相片顯示，該豉油並非採用一般的塑膠豉油包或魚仔樽，而是裝在一個帶刻度的透明藥水樽內，黑色豉油浸滿半樽，遠看與咳藥水如出一轍。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"834096135_17984311662116641_1475157509429554173_n.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026prMiHMjwfn1791527556.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"834096135_17984311662116641_1475157509429554173_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"832557122_17984311647116641_5793716729922022233_n.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260L0VOz7OJ31791527549.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"832557122_17984311647116641_5793716729922022233_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">樓主隨後特意查證該藥水樽的資料，發現其成本亦算高昂，並貼出顯示「MADE IN HONG KONG」字樣的底座圖片，驚喜留言：「香港製造仲要2蚊個 」。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">如此趣怪的畫面吸引無數網民湧入留言，紛紛發揮幽默感搞笑回應：</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left\">·       醫生上身搞笑派：大批網民順著藥水樽造型大開玩笑，留言指：「Sorry 畀錯咗咳藥水你，方唔方便用拎返過嚟同你換返支豉油。」、「你咳就唔好食生冷野，乖啦」、「愈食愈上癮」、「一日三次，每次一格，記得唔好空肚食」。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left\">·       力撐港產品質派：亦有眼尖網民大讚店家捨得用料且支持本地工業，留言指：「香港製造，難得」、「抵讚」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T07:19:56.334161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":434,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}